### Detailed Bug Description

I was using intellij to debug an issue on another mod and when I enabled to breakpoint on `any exception`, this piece of code was throwing every tick

```diff
public class MCEFUtil {
   public static volatile boolean MCEF_critical_failure = false;
   public static volatile boolean MCEF_initialized = false;

   public static boolean isMCEFLoaded() {
      if (MCEF_critical_failure) {
         return false;
      } else if (FancyMenu.getOptions().devForceMcefMissing.getValue()) {
         return false;
      } else {
         try {
            Class.forName("com.cinemamod.mcef.MCEF", false, FancyMenu.class.getClassLoader());
            return true;
         } catch (Exception var1) {
+           MCEF_critical_failure = true; // seems like this is missing
