### Detailed Bug Description

When using the MenuBackgrounds feature GLSL Shader, the shader renders on top of the menu UI elements (buttons, text, titles), completely obscuring them. However, when switching the background type to a Image, it works perfectly fine and renders behind the UI as expected.

Shadercode used:
```
